## Distributable release zips live in the FFXIV master dist/ folder (outside
## this repo); this repo never tracks them. GitHub Releases (built by CI on a
## v* tag) hold the canonical copy; the *.zip catch-all also stops any stray
## zip from cluttering the repo root.
*.zip

